                    "value": "Costs are shown as positive amounts. Gross Profit and EBIT are calculated rows driven by Dim_Account, not sums of the lines above them, so the statement has no grand total. Variance is signed so that positive is always favourable: revenue lines use Actual less Budget, cost lines use Budget less Actual. Amounts are in EUR exactly as supplied - the dataset states no scale. The dataset carries no interest rows, so EBIT is the bottom line and the Interest and Net Profit accounts return no values.",
